SHA-256 matched this worktree before edits. Selection is its own 12 stratified directions (3 each of
snowline, treeline, coast and range), reused for AFTER. Evidence: `test-results/mountains/M0/report.json`
and `report.txt`; variant subdirectories `corner-L7`, `midpoint-L7`, `midpoint-L6`. Each directory also
contains four Node PNGs (Maithea/Lethuris, L6/L8), with the 12 tiles stacked vertically, BEFORE left and
